[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3338362100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110920#issuecomment-3338362100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110920","id":3338362100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7G-1z0","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T12:07:00Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T12:07:00Z","body":"Awesome! How easily and performantly could the button's icon be dynamically changed to the editor icon of the resource's type? So if you're preloading a `AtlasTexture`, it'd use the AtlasTexture.svg icon for the button, etc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3338362100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3338718647","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110920#issuecomment-3338718647","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110920","id":3338718647,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HAM23","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T13:23:59Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T13:23:59Z","body":"I haven't looked at the code, but there is some corner case: we have a \"preload\" from \"uid://\" to a file, we can see the path to this resource in the inline resource picker. This file is then moved to another folder. Thus, the path in inline resource picker must be updated at the same time as the file is moved.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3338718647/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340255541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110920#issuecomment-3340255541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110920","id":3340255541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HGEE1","user":{"login":"sockeye-d","id":106356149,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlbdtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106356149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d","html_url":"https://github.com/sockeye-d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T19:50:36Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T19:50:36Z","body":"> Awesome! How easily and performantly could the button's icon be dynamically changed to the editor icon of the resource's type? So if you're preloading a `AtlasTexture`, it'd use the AtlasTexture.svg icon for the button, etc.\n\nI'm not entirely sure that's useful — the inline button is for loading resources and it would be confusing if it was just some random icon that if you clicked on it it opened a popup.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340255541/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340610514","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110920#issuecomment-3340610514","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110920","id":3340610514,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HHavS","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T21:44:50Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T21:44:50Z","body":"> I'm not entirely sure that's useful\r\n\r\nBorh uid paths and .tres/.res extension are indirections that make it hard to know what type of resource you actually are dealing with. It's the same reason the color picker icon is showing the color, since the rgb/hex codes are hard to read at a glance. It's also consistent with file system dock for the most part.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340610514/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340696480","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110920#issuecomment-3340696480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110920","id":3340696480,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HHvug","user":{"login"