t handlers are not exposed to GDScript. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108822 does, but it's unfinished and I think I want to change the example to something more like this\r\n\r\nI would continue down that path then, specially since it could open the possibility for people to add features like this custom to their projects as well. \r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3585047236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3585223581","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110920#issuecomment-3585223581","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110920","id":3585223581,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Vsiud","user":{"login":"sockeye-d","id":106356149,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlbdtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106356149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d","html_url":"https://github.com/sockeye-d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-27T10:51:54Z","updated_at":"2025-11-27T10:51:54Z","body":"@AThousandShips I don't think it's worth reviewin